      "dimensions": "Painting only: 21.8 x 76.6 cm (8 9/16 x 30 3/16 in.); Overall: 36.6 x 89.2 cm (14 7/16 x 35 1/8 in.)",
      "movement_zh": "元代山水",
      "tags": [
